  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Driving high quality sustainability disclosure and exploring the sustainable finance market in China</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is designed to enhance UK-China collaborations in sustainability disclosure and explore opportunities in green and sustainable finance. The project will focus on building the capacity of Chinese financial institutions and companies in climate and transition plan disclosure, aligning local practices with mainstream international standards. It is well linked to previous projects funded by the UK Government, and it will continue to boost connections between UK and China financial communities and increase transparency of the China&#x2019;s capital markets for UK investors.</narrative>
  </description>
